    {
      "text": "um, you know, just doing the \"I'm fine\" face while internally screaming. Then this older guy behind me started talking. He pointed at the magazines and said, \"You think any of that stuff's true?\" And I laughed. I said, \"Probably not, but it helps pass the time, right?\" We ended up chatting for a bit about random stuff, how lines never move, the weather, weekend plans. It was actually kind of nice. Finally, the cashier waved me forward, and the guy goes, \"Guess we survived.\" I just laughed and said, \"Barely.\" And that was it. Nothing special, but you know, one of those tiny moments that somehow makes a long wait a little less boring.",
      "start_time": 36.18,
